    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyway, the world has already been destroyed, let's have a leisurely doomsday outing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world that has already been destroyed, leisurely explore the various aspects of the old era, collect old objects before the world's destruction, and enjoy this eerie journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game elements:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Experience post apocalyptic survival, walk your own path under the lonely starry sky</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Collect old items from the past, some will make your journey more interesting, while others will come in handy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Explore unknown areas and see the various remnants left behind before the world was destroyed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Piecing together fragmented information to understand the secret behind the entire world becoming like this</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your playing :)</p>",
